# Bottom navigation PNG (user-owned)

`public/bottom-menu-bar/bottom-menu-bar.png` is **user-authored artwork**. The user replaces this file manually.

## Forbidden

- Do **not** crop, resize, re-export, or overwrite the PNG with Python, ImageMagick, or shell scripts.
- Do **not** restore the PNG from git history (`git show …:bottom-menu-bar.png`).
- Do **not** substitute art from old commits or derived/agent-generated variants.

## Allowed

- Read pixel dimensions (readonly) to sync `BOTTOM_MENU_ARTBOARD` in `lib/navigation/bottom-nav-config.ts`.
- Bump the `?v=` cache-bust query on `BOTTOM_MENU_BAR_SRC` when dimensions change.
- Adjust CSS in `app/globals.css` (`.bottom-dock*`) for layout — use `object-fit: contain` and height from artboard aspect ratio only. Never `object-fit: fill` or height clamps that distort aspect.

## Hotspots

Keep five equal columns in `BOTTOM_NAV_HOTSPOTS` unless the user changes tab layout.
